s tab, either one at a time or as a marked [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]bulk set. Installs go through the same confirmed, shell-free [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]installer that backs `sase agent-cli install`, which now also [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]installs npm-packaged CLIs. The previewed bytes are exactly the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]bytes that run, and every outcome (success, not on PATH, failure) [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]stays visible afterwards.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]updates_tab_agent_cli_install.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/updates_tab_agent_cli_install.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-171[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-171/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared installer learns npm-packaged CLIs[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]npm-installs[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]npm-installs: add a pure install-route classifier, npm-package install [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]planning with npm/PATH/writability checks, plan-time PATH status, and a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]per-entry progress hook in sase.agent_clis; update `sase agent-cli [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]install` rendering, JSON, help, hints, and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Install flow in the Updates tab[/bold #D7AFFF]                               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]tui-install[dim] · [dim][/dim]after npm-installs[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tui-install: give missing agent-CLI rows an install verb on i / Space / [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]I, a redesigned install detail panel, a digest-bearing confirm preview, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a tracked sequential install proc, one combined flow for mixed plugin + [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]CLI marks, install-aware history, result lines, and toasts, plus tests, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs, and goldens.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Discoverability and bulk-select accelerators[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]discover-bulk[dim] · [dim][/dim]after tui-install[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]discover-bulk: add the Available scope, the `*` mark-all-like-this key, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a cross-scope hint when a filter matches nothing, the final detail [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]call-to-action, docs, and goldens.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-171","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-171.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-c9e87d5a73157395f4f0fef25f143b35","started_at":"2026-09-23T16:26:50.760679+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-171","bbugyi200.athena.sase-171.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-171.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-171.3","bbugyi200.athena.sase-171.land"]}
